<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetTexture(Texture: string|uuid, Face: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetTexture(string Texture, integer Face);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> diffuse <b>texture</b> of this prim's <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Texture / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/texture" target="_blank">texture</a></td>
          <td>a texture in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of a texture</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Face / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Face" target="_blank">face</a> number or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
        <li>prim_appearance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Sleep</span><span class="tech-val">0.2s</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">53</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>face</b> is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a> then the function works on all sides.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function causes the script to sleep for 0.2 seconds.</li>
    <li>The function silently fails if its <b>face</b> value indicates a face that does not exist.</li>
    <li>If <b>texture</b> is missing from the prim's inventory and it is not a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> or it is not a texture then an error is shouted on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/DEBUG_CHANNEL" target="_blank">DEBUG_CHANNEL</a>.</li>
    <li>If <b>texture</b> is a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> then there are no new <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Permissions/Asset" target="_blank">asset permissions</a> consequences for the object.
    <ul>
      <li>The resulting object develops no new usage restrictions that might have occurred if the asset had been placed in the prims inventory.</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
    <li><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=Inspect&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">Inspect</a> does not show texture information (like <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetInventoryCreator" target="_blank">creator</a>)</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function main()
    -- the first texture alphabetically inside the same prim's inventory
    local texture = ll.GetInventoryName(INVENTORY_TEXTURE, 0)

    -- set it on all sides of the prim containing the script
    ll.SetTexture(texture, ALL_SIDES)
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        // the first texture alphabetically inside the same prim's inventory
        string texture = llGetInventoryName(INVENTORY_TEXTURE, 0);

        // set it on all sides of the prim containing the script
        llSetTexture(texture, ALL_SIDES);
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
